{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>觀塘翠屏道2號觀塘泳池發生女子遇溺案件。今早（14日）8時許，警方接獲泳池職員報案，指一名女子於泳池內懷疑遇溺。警員到場發現六十餘歲女事主已由救生員救起、半昏迷女事主最後由救護車送往聯合醫院搶救。案件仍在調查中、警方列作有人遇溺處理。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T03:18:37.321449+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T01:18:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T03:12:04.146335+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T03:12:04.146335+00:00","content_hash":"3e3f3c0e42adc876728fc7c8a05be3541b815dcccc4260abebb7e60ee1041aec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}